Subject: [PATCH] AI: routine file + a simulated year, 16-week window,
 kitchen/bathroom devices

- ai/personas/student_studio.toml + ai/persona.py: one student in a studio
  (stable / varying / unusual days, semesters, exams, Ramadan, trips, Hebron weather)
- ai/lifesim.py: a minute-by-minute year recorded like the Pi (1.64 M readings)
- ai/experiment_year.py: walk-forward evaluation vs yesterday / last week / all history
- training window 16 weeks, half-life 28 days (chosen on validation weeks, reported on held-out weeks)
- features: room humidity, time home / away
- seed: kitchen light + hood, fridge + kettle (monitor), bathroom light + vent, SHT31 0x45, windowless bathroom
- twin lives the routine file; the hotter/cooler control acts outside the room inertia
- web: hood / vent / kettle icons, RoomConfig.windowless (additive)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
